    "chunk_text": "PART III - LANDS NOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO PROPERTY OF INTESTATE REGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT NO. 21 OF 1998 (SECTION 55) Reference the intestate property of late Mr. Solanga Arachchige Vimalasena Perera who resided in the village of Rilawala, in the Divi-sional Secretary\u2019s Division of Homagama, in the District of Colombo. It is hereby notified that any person/s who have a claim to or interest in the intestate property of the late Mr. Solanga Arachchige Vi-malasena Perera described in the Schedule hereto should submit his/their claim to the undersigned in writing before 12th July, 2019 stating his/their right or interest to such intestate property. In case of failure to do so, exparte action will be taken to register title under Section 55 (2) and (3) of the Registration of Title Act. No. 21 of 1998. K.A.K. RANJITH DHARMAPALA, Commissioner of Title Settlement. (Actg.) Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Madura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 28th May, 2019\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0001 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u000f \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0013 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0016 \u0db4\u0018\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0002 \u0004\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2129/30 - 2019 \u0011\u0012 25 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0012 \u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4\u0018\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.06.25\n\nNo. 2129/30 \u2013 TUESDAY, JUNE 25, 2019\n\nN.B.\u2013 This Extraordinary Gazette can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 30354 - 14 (2019/06)\n\n2 A\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u001a\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0001 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0007\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf \u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u000f \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0013 \u0d85 \u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0016 \u0db4\u0018\u0dba - 2019.06.25 PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRA ORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 25.06.2019\n\nSCHEDULE Divisional Village Cadastral Parcel No. Extent of Land Certificate Office of Secretary\u2019s Division Map No. of Title No. Registration\n\n(Hectare) Homagama Rilawala 520024 Block 07 0.0716 0038611 Homagama Parcel No. 25 N.B.- Letters claiming a right to intestate property should mention the Cadastral Map number, parcel number and the entitlement of the claimant to claim such property. The top left-hand corner of the envelope should bear the phrase \u201cApplication for Intestate Property.\u201d"
