    "chunk_text": "Member of the Evaluation Board of Local Films watch films and then select films under the categories such as films withclassical - attractive characteristics ,films with commercial-attractive characteristics and films with the combination ofclassical - attractive characteristics and commercial-attractive characteristics for screening at Cinema Halls.\n\nThe composition of the above mentioned Board of Appeal of evaluation of local films is as follows.\n\n*One member from Evaluation Board of Local Films, who has not participated to watch relevant film,\n\n*Two members from Scheduling Committee ( Out of the members appointed to the relevant committee, arepresentative from Cinema Hall owners and one member from three independent members appointed by theChairman of the Corporation on the approval of the Board of Directors should be included.)\n\nGeneral Manager,National Film Corporation.28.06.2019\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'07'03PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA 03.07.201914A\n\nAnnex - 05\n\nNFC/108/AGM/01/2019/04\n\nCOMPOSITION OF THE SCHEDULING COMMITTEE OF FILMS\n\nThe role of this committee is to make recommendations for scheduling films for screening at Cinema Halls and itscomposition is as follows;\n\n*Representations from owners of all Cinema Halls or Lessees, who screen local films maintaining not lessthan 5 Cinema Halls.\n\n*One representative from each province representing other Cinema Halls, which are not fallen under theCinema Halls, indicated in 01 above and screening local.\n\n*Three independent persons appointed by the Chairman of the Corporation on the approval of the Board ofDirectors\n\nGeneral Manager,National Film Corporation of Sri Lanka.\n\n28.06.2019\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'07'03PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA 03.07.201915A\n\nAnnex - 06\n\nNFC/114/03/47"
